<section class="section grid offer-section" aria-labelledby="help-h">
  <h2 id="help-h" class="rail eyebrow strong">Ways to work together</h2>
  <ol class="span-wide offers">
    <li class="offer">
      <h3 class="offer-title serif">Launching something new</h3>
      <p class="offer-text">A product, a venture, a new office or a new line of business. AI makes it easier than ever to build the wrong thing in a weekend, so most of the work is deciding what’s worth building, then getting a small version in front of the people it’s for.</p>
      <p class="offer-proof">I’ve done this at <a href="/leading/launching-new-ventures-at-aol/" class="ul">AOL</a>, where I helped launch AOL Industry from zero, at <a href="/leading/bringing-north-kingdom-to-the-us/" class="ul">North Kingdom</a>, opening its US operation, and with <a href="/leading/wildebeest/" class="ul">Wildebeest</a>, the studio I co-founded.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="offer">
      <h3 class="offer-title serif">Solving tough problems with software</h3>
      <p class="offer-text">When a process is slow, a team is stuck or AI keeps coming up without a plan. I think AI should raise a team’s ambition, and the fastest way to find out how is to build something small, see if people use it twice, and be honest when they don’t.</p>
      <p class="offer-proof">At <a href="/leading/building-the-next-chapter-of-thoughtbot/" class="ul">thoughtbot</a>, I’ve reshaped how a consultancy grows and delivers, and I build <a href="/writing/building-tools-for-my-team/" class="ul">tools for my own team</a> to test what AI can really do.</p>
    </li>
    <li class="offer">
      <h3 class="offer-title serif">Bringing ideas into physical spaces</h3>
      <p class="offer-text">Events, community programs and the places people gather deserve the same care as any product. Some of my favorite projects never had a screen.</p>
      <p class="offer-proof">I built <a href="/leading/why-leave-astoria/" class="ul">a neighborhood network</a> with more than 10,000 members, and in <a href="/leading/produce-movie-nights-and-a-cleanup/" class="ul">Ladera Heights</a> I’ve run produce pickups, drive-in movie nights and a monthly cleanup. With <a href="https://www.johngist.com/" class="ul">John Gist</a> I co-founded RELIC, which has sold <a href="/leading/diy-kits-and-who-does-the-work/" class="ul">thousands of DIY kits</a>.</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

