<section class="section grid offer-section" aria-labelledby="how-h">
  <h2 id="how-h" class="rail eyebrow strong">How it starts</h2>
  <ol class="span-main steps">
    <li><span class="step-n">1</span><span><strong>You tell me about it.</strong> What you’re trying to do, where you’re stuck, and your timing. A few sentences is plenty.</span></li>
    <li><span class="step-n">2</span><span><strong>We talk.</strong> A conversation to understand the idea and the people it’s for, and to see if I’m the right fit.</span></li>
    <li><span class="step-n">3</span><span><strong>We decide the next step together.</strong> That might be a short piece of advice, a focused project, or an introduction to someone better suited.</span></li>
  </ol>
</section>

